{"title":"Iron for the Forge","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">The smiths at the Mining Trainer&#39;s stall use iron faster than anyone brings it in.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/mining-trainer\">Mining Trainer</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"mining-trainer\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Skill unlocks</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>The <a href=\"#/guide/mining\">Mining</a> skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/iron-ore\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bffa864aa99d4c870949.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Ore</a> <b>×20</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/mining-trainer\">Mining Trainer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Binxonia)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"mining-trainer\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Mine 20 iron ore and bring it to the Mining Trainer <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/iron-ore\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/bffa864aa99d4c870949.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Ore</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 29, -23</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"29|-23|Mine 20 iron ore and bring it to the Mining Trainer\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>2,000</td></tr><tr><td>Mining XP</td><td>500</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/pickaxe\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/f680e42c9cd479943de6.svg\" alt=\"\">Pickaxe</a><br><a href=\"#/item/smithing-hammer\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/6ffbf1314f120baf6e8d.svg\" alt=\"\">Smithing Hammer</a></td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>the <a href=\"#/guide/mining\">Mining</a> skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Iron for the Forge</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mining-trainer-quest\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mining-trainer-quest\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mining-trainer-quest\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-mining-trainer-quest\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}